      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "numbered",
      "items": [
        "Stack voltage: $$V_{\\mathrm{stack}} = 80 \\times 0.70\\ \\mathrm{V} = 56\\ \\mathrm{V}$$",
        "Electrical power: $$P = 56\\ \\mathrm{V} \\times 40\\ \\mathrm{A} = 2{,}240\\ \\mathrm{W} = 2.24\\ \\mathrm{kW}$$",
        "Electrical energy in 2 hours: $$E = 2.24\\ \\mathrm{kW} \\times 2\\ \\mathrm{h} = 4.48\\ \\mathrm{kWh}$$"
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "style": {
