        "marginBottomPt": 5,
        "backgroundColor": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Result: this example fuel-cell stack delivers 2.24 kW of electrical power and 4.48 kWh of energy over two hours, assuming the voltage and current remain constant.",
      "type": "callout",
